// vProgress, and what only it reaches
//
// A layout of protoStatusTemplate's status slips: status text, a progress
// indicator (protoStatusProgress), a title and the default button. Named
// 'vProgress by a transport's SetStatusDialog; height in pixels.

vProgress := {
	height: 132,
	name: 'vProgress,
	kids: [|Array|: @protoStatusText, @protoStatusProgress, @protoTitleText, @protoDefaultStatusButton]
};
